  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Which statements are correct about degrees of freedom?</p><p>A. A molecule with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> degrees of freedom has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> different ways of storing energy.</p><p>B. Each degree of freedom is associated with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></math> average energy per mole.</p><p>C. A monoatomic gas molecule has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> rotational degree of freedom where as diatomic molecule has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> rotational degrees of freedom</p><p>D. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> has a total to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> degrees of freedom.</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the option given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "qo6dM",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;only",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4J4Vx",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> only",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VDQw1",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;only",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d6aVh",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>&nbsp;only",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
